# Intent: Detect CUI-classified resources deployed outside FedRAMP GovCloud boundaries.
#         AWS GovCloud regions use the "us-gov-" prefix; Azure Government uses "usgov".
#         CUI data must remain within authorized boundaries per NIST SP 800-60 and
#         FedRAMP authorization scope — non-GovCloud deployments risk ATO revocation.
# Expected violation shape: rows where classification == "CUI" and region is non-GovCloud;
#   each row is a potential data-residency or boundary violation requiring immediate review.

foreach r in infra.resources
  where r.classification == "CUI"
  where not r.region startswith "us-gov" and not r.region startswith "usgov"
  select r.id, r.resource_name, r.csp, r.region, r.classification
